"heading","depth":4,"id":"default","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"code","value":"0","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"Listener.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Listener"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"link","href":"Listener.md#triggerdebouncems","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"triggerDebounceMs"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"triggers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"triggers"}]},{"type":"code","value":"triggers: ListenerTriggerOption<FieldListenerTriggers, TFieldData, TFieldValue>[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L191","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:191"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The events that can invoke the listener."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The listener runs at most once for an event, even if multiple entries\nmatch. An empty array disables the listener."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"triggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"Listener.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Listener"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"link","href":"Listener.md#triggers","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"triggers"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"watchfields","children":[{"type":"text","value":"watchFields?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional watchFields?: DeepKeys<TFieldData>[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L482","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:482"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Other fields whose matching events should also invoke this listener."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The callback still receives this listener's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fieldApi"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value"},{"type":"text","value":", not\nthe watched field or its value."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When omitted, the listener receives matching events from its own field and\npropagated descendant events only."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"watchFields: ['firstName', 'lastName'],","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfielddata","text":"TFieldData","level":3},{"id":"tfieldname","text":"TFieldName","level":3},{"id":"tfieldvalue","text":"TFieldValue","level":3},{"id":"tfielderror","text":"TFieldError","level":3},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tformerrortypes","text":"TFormErrorTypes","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"run","text":"run","level":3},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"triggerdebouncems","text":"triggerDebounceMs?","level":3},{"id":"default","text":"Default","level":4},{"id":"inherited-from","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"triggers","text":"triggers","level":3},{"id":"example-3","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"inherited-from-2","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"watchfields","text":"watchFields?","level":3},{"id":"example-4","text":"Example","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:437](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L437)\n\nA listener configured on a field.\n\n`'change'` and `'blur'` events from descendant fields propagate to their\nancestor field listeners. Use `watchFields` to receive matching events from\nother fields.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nlisteners: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change', 'blur'],\n    triggerDebounceMs: 200,\n    watchFields: ['displayName'],\n    run: ({ value, formApi }) => {\n      saveContact({\n        displayName: formApi.getFieldValue('displayName'),\n        email: value,\n      })\n    },\n  },\n],\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`Listener`](Listener.md)\\<[`FieldListenerTriggers`](../type-aliases/FieldListenerTriggers.md), `TFieldData`, `TFieldValue`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFieldData\n\n`TFieldData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFieldName\n\n`TFieldName`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFieldValue\n\n`TFieldValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFieldError\n\n`TFieldError`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormErrorTypes\n\n`TFormErrorTypes` *extends* [`FormErrorTypes`](FormErrorTypes.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### run\n\n```ts\nrun: FieldListenerFn<TFieldName, TFieldValue, TFieldError, TFormData, TFormErrorTypes>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:461](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L461)\n\nCalled when an enabled field trigger occurs.\n\nThe return value is ignored. A returned promise is not awaited, and a\nrejected promise is reported to the console.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nrun: ({ value, fieldApi }) => {\n  const trimmedValue = value.trim()\n  if (trimmedValue !== value) {\n    fieldApi.handleChange(trimmedValue)\n  }\n},\n```\n\n***\n\n### triggerDebounceMs?\n\n```ts\noptional triggerDebounceMs?: \n  | number\n| ListenerDebounceFn<TFieldData, TFieldValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:173](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L173)\n\nThe debounce delay in milliseconds before the listener runs.\n\nA function recalculates the delay for each matching event. Repeated events\nrestart the delay, and the listener receives the latest event context.\nValues less than or equal to `0` run immediately. `'submit'` events always\nrun immediately.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\n0\n```\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`Listener`](Listener.md).[`triggerDebounceMs`](Listener.md#triggerdebouncems)\n\n***\n\n### triggers\n\n```ts\ntriggers: ListenerTriggerOption<FieldListenerTriggers, TFieldData, TFieldValue>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L191)\n\nThe events that can invoke the listener.\n\nThe listener runs at most once for an event, even if multiple entries\nmatch. An empty array disables the listener.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\ntriggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],\n```\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`Listener`](Listener.md).[`triggers`](Listener.md#triggers)\n\n***\n\n### watchFields?\n\n```ts\noptional watchFields?: DeepKeys<TFieldData>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:482](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L482)\n\nOther fields whose matching events should also invoke this listener.\n\nThe callback still receives this listener's `fieldApi` and `value`, not\nthe watched field or its value.\n\nWhen omitted, the listener receives matching events from its own field and\npropagated descendant events only.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nwatchFields: ['firstName', 'lastName'],\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FieldListener\ntitle: FieldListener\n---\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:437](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L437)\n\nA listener configured on a field.\n\n`'change'` and `'blur'` events from descendant fields propagate to their\nancestor field listeners. Use `watchFields` to receive matching events from\nother fields.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nlisteners: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change', 'blur'],\n    triggerDebounceMs: 200,\n    watchFields: ['displayName'],\n    run: ({ value, formApi }) => {\n      saveContact({\n        displayName: formApi.getFieldValue('displayName'),\n        email: value,\n      })\n    },\n  },\n],\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- [`Listener`](Listener.md)\\<[`FieldListenerTriggers`](../type-aliases/FieldListenerTriggers.md), `TFieldData`, `TFieldValue`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFieldData\n\n`TFieldData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFieldName\n\n`TFieldName`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFieldValue\n\n`TFieldValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFieldError\n\n`TFieldError`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormErrorTypes\n\n`TFormErrorTypes` *extends* [`FormErrorTypes`](FormErrorTypes.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### run\n\n```ts\nrun: FieldListenerFn<TFieldName, TFieldValue, TFieldError, TFormData, TFormErrorTypes>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:461](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L461)\n\nCalled when an enabled field trigger occurs.\n\nThe return value is ignored. A returned promise is not awaited, and a\nrejected promise is reported to the console.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nrun: ({ value, fieldApi }) => {\n  const trimmedValue = value.trim()\n  if (trimmedValue !== value) {\n    fieldApi.handleChange(trimmedValue)\n  }\n},\n```\n\n***\n\n### triggerDebounceMs?\n\n```ts\noptional triggerDebounceMs?: \n  | number\n| ListenerDebounceFn<TFieldData, TFieldValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:173](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L173)\n\nThe debounce delay in milliseconds before the listener runs.\n\nA function recalculates the delay for each matching event. Repeated events\nrestart the delay, and the listener receives the latest event context.\nValues less than or equal to `0` run immediately. `'submit'` events always\nrun immediately.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\n0\n```\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`Listener`](Listener.md).[`triggerDebounceMs`](Listener.md#triggerdebouncems)\n\n***\n\n### triggers\n\n```ts\ntriggers: ListenerTriggerOption<FieldListenerTriggers, TFieldData, TFieldValue>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L191)\n\nThe events that can invoke the listener.\n\nThe listener runs at most once for an event, even if multiple entries\nmatch. An empty array disables the listener.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\ntriggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],\n```\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n[`Listener`](Listener.md).[`triggers`](Listener.md#triggers)\n\n***\n\n### watchFields?\n\n```ts\noptional watchFields?: DeepKeys<TFieldData>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:482](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L482)\n\nOther fields whose matching events should also invoke this listener.\n\nThe callback still receives this listener's `fieldApi` and `value`, not\nthe watched field or its value.\n\nWhen omitted, the listener receives matching events from its own field and\npropagated descendant events only.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nwatchFields: ['firstName', 'lastName'],\n```\n"}
